      "simplified": "听说这家餐厅的包子做得不错。",
      "pinyin": "Tīngshuō zhè jiā cāntīng de bāozi zuò de búcuò.",
      "english": "I hear that this restaurant's steamed buns are pretty good.",
      "notes": "",
      "words_used": [
        "听说",
        "包子"
